      "name": "Strigops",
      "rank": "GENUS",
      "description": "A monotypic genus of the world's heaviest parrot and the only nocturnal, flightless parrot. The Kakapo is a remarkable evolutionary anomaly, having traded flight for a terrestrial lifestyle in the predator-free environment of prehistoric New Zealand. It is a lek-breeding species with an unusually long lifespan and slow reproductive rate.",
